Building this fork
==================

Use make and config.mk; see README for installation and upstream imports.
Keep build changes separate from Wi-Fi behavior changes. Refresh the
checked-in mk/sources.mk with scripts/import-upstream after merging an
iwd release, review the resulting source lists, and run make check.

The Makefile.am and configure.ac files are retained as upstream import
metadata. Changes to those files do not affect the supported build until
the manifest is refreshed. Do NOT regenerate Makefile or config.h with
Autohell.
